cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset in a published work, please cite as follows."
title: "Open Data — Divorzio in Italia"
abstract: >-
  Tidy, CSV-formatted extracts of ISTAT official statistics on divorce in
  Italy: age at divorce (husband, wife, both spouses), which spouse filed
  the petition in judicial divorces, separations (counts, rates and length
  of proceedings), and remarriages of divorced people by time elapsed
  since the end of the previous marriage.
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: "2026-10-26"
authors:
  - name: "Legalium S.r.l."
    website: "https://www.divorziare.it"
repository-code: "https://github.com/divorziare/open-data-divorzio-italia"
url: "https://www.divorziare.it"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - italy
  - divorce
  - family law
  - istat
  - open data
  - statistics
  - data journalism
references:
